    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> be the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>cosec</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mo>cosec</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to:",
